Related Jira Story: {{ $('Parse Story Key & Bug Text').item.json.storyKey || 'Not specified' }}
Story Summary: {{ $json.Summary || $json.summary || 'N/A' }}
Story Description/AC:
{{ $json.Description || $json.description || 'N/A' }}

Raw Bug Observation (as reported by the tester):
{{ $('Parse Story Key & Bug Text').item.json.rawBugDescription }}

